stadium_paths.csv.gz: park outlines

The outline paths are the `MLBStadiumsPathData` table from the GeomMLBStadiums
R package by Ben Dilday (https://github.com/bdilday/GeomMLBStadiums), as
redistributed in pybaseball (https://github.com/jldbc/pybaseball). The columns
were reduced to team, segment, x and y, and coordinates rounded to two decimals.
They are in the same pixel grid as Baseball Savant's hc_x / hc_y hit coordinates.

